      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Shoulder pain is usually caused by periarthritis. Impingement syndrome and frozen shoulder (adhesive capsulitis) are the more frequently clinical aspect observed. A shoulder standardised clinical examination often give a precise lesional diagnostic. Complementary examinations are useful to distinguish other cause of shoulder pain."},
